  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Liquified Natural Gas Supply and Natural Gas Infrastructure Reverse Trade Mission Series, through National US Arab Chamber Of Commerce (Inc)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds a reverse trade mission series for two separate and distinct reverse trade missions to introduce delegates from the government and private sectors in Thailand and Vietnam to U.S. technology, regulations and best practices in the gas infrastructure and liquefied natural gas import industries. The delegates will travel to three cities in the United States in order to meet with U.S. companies and conduct site visits to see American technology manufactured and in use.</narrative>
  </description>
